  "releaseNotes": "1.4.0: new API, no breaking changes. Mean-response and prediction intervals: MeanResponseInterval(x, level) and PredictionInterval(x, level) return (Fit, Lower, Upper). Curve fits after TI ST-12: Exponential, Power, Logarithmic, or custom transforms; CurveB, CurveM, PredictY, PredictX in original units; CurveMeanResponseInterval and CurvePredictionInterval. Full notes: https://github.com/NinerXrayBravoTwoTwo/linear-regression-pvalues/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
